T:Luke Oakley's Polka
% NFF Book 2023
S:collected from Orley Benson, Mudgee, NSW
S:collected by John Meredith
H:"The Oakley family were well known in the Cook's Gap - Ulan locality, (Mudgee
H:district, NSW) for their dancing ability and their musicianship. 'Old' Luke
H:Oakley was great man on the fiddle and this lively polka tune is one that
H:he passed on to Orley Benson" - John Meredith, FSA Vol 2, p51
B:J Meredith, R Covell, P Brown, Folk Songs of Australia Vol 2, UNSW Press, p51, 1987
R:Polka
